cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If this index, its methodology, or its synthetic demo data is useful in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "Weibo Attention & Influence Index"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible, fully auditable 1-10 star relative index of public attention
  on Weibo. Stars live on a magnitude axis built from six measurable factors
  (reach, duration, emotional intensity, cross-circle spillover, behaviour
  change, authority intervention); sentiment polarity is reported on a separate
  axis and never folded into the score. Verified events and opinion mentions are
  kept in two separate tables.
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-11"
license: MIT
type: software
